{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "9b12a801-7fa8-48b2-b5e1-d8975ce7c834",
		"name": "Sistem Pakar Diabetes Melitus API",
		"description": "Koleksi API lengkap untuk Sistem Pakar Diagnosis Diabetes Melitus (Metode Certainty Factor).\n\nBase URL default: `{{base_url}}` (default: `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`).\n\n### Cara Penggunaan:\n1. Buka request **1. Auth > Login**\n2. Klik **Send** menggunakan akun default:\n   - Email: `admin@glucoseplus.com`\n   - Password: `password`\n3. Token Bearer otomatis disimpan ke variabel `{{bearer_token}}` melalui Test Script.\n4. Semua request yang memerlukan otentikasi (Admin) otomatis menggunakan token tersebut.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{bearer_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "bearer_token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Authentication",
			"description": "Endpoint manajemen otentikasi (Sanctum)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login (Auto-set Token)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.token) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"bearer_token\", jsonData.data.token);",
									"        console.log(\"Token berhasil disimpan:\", jsonData.data.token);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@glucoseplus.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Login menggunakan email & password. Script otomatis menyimpan Bearer Token ke variabel koleksi."
					},
					"response": []
				},
